Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of RNA m6A Sites Using Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zhike", "Fu",
           email = "Zhike.Fu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides random forest-based prediction of RNA
    N6-methyladenosine (m6A) sites using sequence and transcript
    features. Supports predictions for individual sites and batches
    of observations, returning probabilities and classification
    results. Includes a pretrained model and example input data.
License: MIT
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
